NOTE for operator applying this patch:
  In `update()` (around the call site that invokes `_find_hole_wrench`), add a single
  line BEFORE the call to cache F_lat_baselink so the directed-sweep code can read it:
      self._last_F_lat_baselink = F_lat_baselink
  This avoids changing the `_find_hole_wrench` signature (which is called from
  multiple sites in the existing FSM). One-line change, idempotent, safe to leave
  in place even if the directed-sweep flag is later disabled.
